## Agent Workflow

SPQR v1.1 — every task has a Notion ticket. Every agent = new session; stateless.
Laws: .claude/rules/AGENT_LAWS.md (auto-loaded)
Tab name: TICKET-XXX — Agent Name. Ticket comment at every major checkpoint.

OPUS (feature): Senate: Consilium → Praetor → Tribunus → Probator → Curator → Senate: Censura
On veto: Praetor (fix) → Tribunus / Probator (verify)
EXPLORATIO (spike): Senate: Consilium → Quaestor → Senate: Censura
Quaestor = spike researcher; output: decision doc, no code

HANDOFF SIGNALS — every agent output must include:
still_solving: [one sentence restating the ticket goal]
expected_outputs: [what the next agent must verify]
addressed: [confirmation previous expected_outputs were met]

MANDATORY CHECKPOINTS — owner must approve before proceeding:
- CLAUDE.md update needed
- Curator verdict: Needs Work
- Senate Censura verdict: RED

